# (case, step title) -> the oracle side's termination the step is designed to produce (audit
# 4r2, SV-2): such a step is IDENTICAL when both sides end so with equal transcripts; the oracle
# ending otherwise is ORACLE-UNEXPECTED. Every other failure is BOTH-FAILED when equal (listed,
# never a match). Values: the case design, as the oracle showed it in every stored run
